00:01:06.656 --> 00:01:12.422
♪As dawn's first light
sketches the sky's outline♪

00:01:12.422 --> 00:01:18.692
♪Entwined between our fingertips♪

00:01:20.256 --> 00:01:26.208
♪When destiny weaves a brilliant net♪

00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:32.000
♪Our souls are forged from the shards♪

00:01:32.246 --> 00:01:35.584
=Flying Up Without Disturb=

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.003
=Episode 24=

00:01:57.763 --> 00:01:58.763
What is this place?

00:01:58.884 --> 00:02:00.203
Why did you bring me here?

00:02:00.403 --> 00:02:01.524
From now on,

00:02:01.604 --> 00:02:03.084
this will be your residence.

00:02:05.684 --> 00:02:07.003
You did well just now.

00:02:09.044 --> 00:02:09.884
Thanks to you.

00:02:10.124 --> 00:02:10.884
It was my duty.

00:02:11.963 --> 00:02:12.844
But Kong Hou, you...

00:02:13.044 --> 00:02:14.044
Aren't you supposed

00:02:14.124 --> 00:02:15.324
to address me respectfully.

00:02:16.844 --> 00:02:18.523
Alright, Your Eminence.

00:02:19.044 --> 00:02:20.404
It seems you will soon

00:02:20.404 --> 00:02:21.763
understand the joy of power.

00:02:22.363 --> 00:02:23.243
Power

00:02:23.884 --> 00:02:25.363
is indeed a good thing.

00:02:26.203 --> 00:02:27.404
Though you say so,

00:02:27.564 --> 00:02:28.724
I can feel

00:02:28.844 --> 00:02:30.083
that you're not very familiar

00:02:30.203 --> 00:02:31.363
with having power.

00:02:31.444 --> 00:02:32.683
You used to follow

00:02:32.683 --> 00:02:34.324
those so-called righteous sects,

00:02:34.324 --> 00:02:35.844
running around.

00:02:36.044 --> 00:02:37.164
You shouldn't do that again.

00:02:37.643 --> 00:02:38.763
From now on,

00:02:39.044 --> 00:02:40.044
you are the Sovereign.

00:02:40.203 --> 00:02:41.363
leading the Yueluo Clan.

00:02:41.483 --> 00:02:42.643
Life and death

00:02:42.923 --> 00:02:44.324
are within your grasp.

00:02:45.124 --> 00:02:46.083
This power

00:02:46.483 --> 00:02:48.243
is the trust given to you by the clan.

00:02:48.444 --> 00:02:49.604
Appreciate it well.

00:02:52.683 --> 00:02:53.763
Trust?

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:58.284
So, what do they mean

00:02:58.643 --> 00:02:59.963
by that?

00:03:01.604 --> 00:03:03.404
It's for your safety.

00:03:03.803 --> 00:03:06.044
Aren't you still suspicious of me?

00:03:06.884 --> 00:03:08.884
But do you think I care?

00:03:09.243 --> 00:03:11.523
Anyway, I'm tired.

00:03:11.643 --> 00:03:13.004
I don't want to be disturbed.

00:03:13.284 --> 00:03:14.483
Take them with you

00:03:14.483 --> 00:03:15.523
and leave.

00:03:16.004 --> 00:03:16.683
Your Eminence.

00:03:17.604 --> 00:03:18.884
Didn't you

00:03:19.044 --> 00:03:21.004
hear my words?

00:03:22.404 --> 00:03:23.803
You just said

00:03:23.923 --> 00:03:26.324
you wanted me to taste the power.

00:03:26.763 --> 00:03:28.884
Brother, didn't you?

00:03:29.444 --> 00:03:30.004
Alright,

00:03:30.604 --> 00:03:31.604
if it makes you happy.

00:03:31.884 --> 00:03:33.004
I feared you weren't used to

00:03:33.004 --> 00:03:34.004
your new identity.

00:03:34.363 --> 00:03:36.564
It seems I've overthought it.

00:03:37.044 --> 00:03:38.363
We've recognized each other.

00:03:38.564 --> 00:03:40.044
There's plenty of time ahead.

00:03:48.643 --> 00:03:50.483
(I wonder how Zhong Xi is doing.)

00:03:56.763 --> 00:03:57.404
Master.

00:03:59.444 --> 00:04:00.083
Master.

00:04:00.404 --> 00:04:01.523
How is Young Master doing?

00:04:01.923 --> 00:04:03.803
Our leader is still treating him.

00:04:03.963 --> 00:04:05.324
His condition is still unstable.

00:04:08.124 --> 00:04:09.564
You're being too inconsiderate.

00:04:09.724 --> 00:04:11.164
Even if it was for him,

00:04:11.363 --> 00:04:12.444
you shouldn't have

00:04:12.444 --> 00:04:13.444
helped them escape.

00:04:14.523 --> 00:04:15.923
If we hadn't found that you were

00:04:16.044 --> 00:04:17.164
in contact with him,

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:19.164
we almost couldn't save Zhong Xi.

00:04:19.443 --> 00:04:19.923
I...

00:04:22.123 --> 00:04:22.683
Forget it.

00:04:23.964 --> 00:04:25.764
I have to discuss matters with Heng Yan.

00:04:26.164 --> 00:04:27.284
You wait here.

00:04:27.483 --> 00:04:28.084
Yes.

00:04:42.644 --> 00:04:44.524
Your injuries are so severe.

00:04:46.243 --> 00:04:47.164
Zhong Xi,

00:04:47.844 --> 00:04:49.363
whether you can pull through this

00:04:50.604 --> 00:04:52.604
will depend on you now.

00:04:59.243 --> 00:05:00.084
Master.

00:05:03.084 --> 00:05:04.524
Master Zhong Xi has returned.

00:05:04.524 --> 00:05:05.483
Did you know?

00:05:06.644 --> 00:05:08.204
I was just about to go see him,

00:05:08.323 --> 00:05:09.483
but you summoned me here.

00:05:10.803 --> 00:05:11.683
Ling Bo,

00:05:13.123 --> 00:05:15.204
you're too emotional.

00:05:18.683 --> 00:05:20.644
About me covering their escape,

00:05:20.764 --> 00:05:22.683
Master, you already know?

00:05:22.803 --> 00:05:23.883
Previously,

00:05:23.883 --> 00:05:25.483
I already covered up for you.

00:05:25.563 --> 00:05:26.683
Because you and Kong Hou

00:05:26.683 --> 00:05:28.003
are casual acquaintances,

00:05:28.123 --> 00:05:29.604
you let her go.

00:05:30.803 --> 00:05:32.363
You really shouldn't have done that.

00:05:32.683 --> 00:05:34.644
Master, please trust me.

00:05:34.644 --> 00:05:35.563
It's not because

00:05:35.563 --> 00:05:36.644
she and I

00:05:36.644 --> 00:05:37.524
are acquaintances.

00:05:37.683 --> 00:05:39.443
You're too naive.

00:05:40.604 --> 00:05:42.044
What if you get deceived?

00:05:42.164 --> 00:05:43.404
I'm not deceived.

00:05:43.563 --> 00:05:45.164
I chose to do that myself.

00:05:45.524 --> 00:05:47.084
Kong Hou hasn't learned evil skills.

00:05:47.323 --> 00:05:48.604
Nor has she harmed anyone.

00:05:48.683 --> 00:05:49.604
Why does Lingyou Realm

00:05:49.604 --> 00:05:50.563
reject her?

00:05:51.563 --> 00:05:52.644
It's my fault

00:05:52.644 --> 00:05:54.084
for spoiling you

00:05:54.084 --> 00:05:55.003
excessively.

00:05:55.164 --> 00:05:57.084
You actually secretly
release a dark cultivator!

00:05:57.284 --> 00:05:58.164
Do you realize

00:05:58.323 --> 00:05:59.524
what calamities your actions

00:05:59.524 --> 00:06:00.923
might bring to Lingyou Realm?

00:06:01.243 --> 00:06:02.084
You're gambling

00:06:02.084 --> 00:06:04.284
with the safety
of the entire Lingyou Realm!

00:06:04.284 --> 00:06:05.084
Do you understand?

00:06:05.084 --> 00:06:05.883
No, I don't.

00:06:06.683 --> 00:06:07.644
If we don't protect

00:06:07.644 --> 00:06:08.844
a living person like Kong Hou,

00:06:08.844 --> 00:06:09.764
then what exactly

00:06:10.044 --> 00:06:10.844
have we

00:06:10.844 --> 00:06:12.123
been claiming

00:06:12.204 --> 00:06:13.524
to protect?

00:06:13.923 --> 00:06:14.644
Master,

00:06:15.044 --> 00:06:16.443
I'll thoroughly investigate

00:06:16.524 --> 00:06:18.243
and prove Kong Hou's innocence to you.

00:06:18.764 --> 00:06:20.084
I'm not

00:06:20.164 --> 00:06:21.524
being reckless.

00:06:21.604 --> 00:06:22.883
Go if you must.

00:06:23.524 --> 00:06:25.323
You'll understand me

00:06:25.323 --> 00:06:26.844
only after hitting the wall.

00:06:27.563 --> 00:06:29.003
I know you care about me.

00:06:29.844 --> 00:06:31.844
But I beg you

00:06:32.164 --> 00:06:33.044
to trust me.

00:06:46.323 --> 00:06:47.644
Your master scolded you, right?

00:06:50.284 --> 00:06:50.883
But

00:06:50.964 --> 00:06:52.243
I know what I'm doing.

00:06:53.644 --> 00:06:54.363
From now on,

00:06:54.784 --> 00:06:56.404
keep your distance
from Young Master and me

00:06:56.483 --> 00:06:57.563
to avoid further trouble.

00:06:57.563 --> 00:06:59.404
What's done is done.

00:06:59.764 --> 00:07:00.404
Besides,

00:07:00.443 --> 00:07:01.604
I didn't act for your sake.

00:07:02.644 --> 00:07:03.844
All I want now is to know

00:07:04.284 --> 00:07:05.164
what happened

00:07:05.164 --> 00:07:06.284
after they left.

00:07:06.524 --> 00:07:07.164
Why was

00:07:07.164 --> 00:07:08.563
Master Zhong Xi gravely injured?

00:07:09.204 --> 00:07:11.604
He was hurt by Kong Hou,

00:07:11.604 --> 00:07:12.724
and then she left with Jiusu.

00:07:12.844 --> 00:07:13.604
What?

00:07:14.363 --> 00:07:15.563
I'm not sure either

00:07:16.363 --> 00:07:17.483
if we make a mistake

00:07:17.883 --> 00:07:18.964
in helping them escape.

00:08:08.363 --> 00:08:09.084
Kong Hou.

00:08:20.483 --> 00:08:21.204
Mother.

00:08:23.803 --> 00:08:24.563
Your Eminence.

00:08:28.084 --> 00:08:29.003
Who are you?

00:08:29.404 --> 00:08:30.443
I'm Xiao Pei,

00:08:30.604 --> 00:08:31.724
sent by Lord Jiusu

00:08:31.803 --> 00:08:33.044
to serve Your Eminence.

00:08:33.484 --> 00:08:34.764
Serve me?

00:08:35.404 --> 00:08:36.644
You're watching me, aren't you?

00:08:37.364 --> 00:08:38.563
I wouldn't dare.

00:08:38.963 --> 00:08:40.004
Lord Jiusu

00:08:40.124 --> 00:08:41.644
has received news from Lingyou Realm

00:08:41.923 --> 00:08:42.764
and sent me

00:08:42.843 --> 00:08:44.203
to invite you to see him and talk.

00:08:44.563 --> 00:08:46.044
Seeing you resting earlier,

00:08:46.164 --> 00:08:47.524
I dared not disturb you.

00:08:47.923 --> 00:08:49.404
Since I'm your leader,

00:08:50.083 --> 00:08:51.563
ask him to come to my place

00:08:52.124 --> 00:08:54.364
and talk to me.

00:08:55.644 --> 00:08:57.364
I'll be waiting here.

00:09:04.963 --> 00:09:05.563
Kong Hou.

00:09:06.083 --> 00:09:07.364
I heard Zhong Xi

00:09:08.203 --> 00:09:09.884
suffered serious injuries.

00:09:10.723 --> 00:09:12.484
Such meaningless news

00:09:12.923 --> 00:09:14.284
need not be repeated.

00:09:18.004 --> 00:09:18.843
What's this?

00:09:20.443 --> 00:09:21.404
The cultivation manual

00:09:21.404 --> 00:09:22.443
of our clan.

00:09:22.683 --> 00:09:24.603
Let us practice it together.

00:09:24.884 --> 00:09:25.843
One day,

00:09:26.164 --> 00:09:27.563
our cultivation will grow a lot.

00:09:29.404 --> 00:09:30.244
I don't need it.

00:09:30.764 --> 00:09:31.443
Your Eminence.

00:09:32.124 --> 00:09:32.683
This manual

00:09:32.683 --> 00:09:33.923
contains centuries of wisdom

00:09:33.923 --> 00:09:35.644
from our ancestors.

00:09:36.124 --> 00:09:37.443
It could

00:09:37.764 --> 00:09:39.044
enhance your cultivation.

00:09:39.284 --> 00:09:40.923
I said I don't need it.

00:09:41.803 --> 00:09:43.404
I don't need it at all.

00:09:43.963 --> 00:09:45.244
I have Five Spiritual Roots,

00:09:45.563 --> 00:09:46.963
so improving my cultivation

00:09:47.203 --> 00:09:48.603
is effortless.

00:09:49.484 --> 00:09:51.644
I don't need this manual.
Take this away.

00:09:52.284 --> 00:09:52.723
Kong Hou.

00:09:53.644 --> 00:09:55.164
Your constitution isn't just talent.

00:09:55.644 --> 00:09:56.963
It's also a responsibility.

00:09:57.244 --> 00:09:58.364
I've told you before.

00:09:58.803 --> 00:10:00.004
Address me properly.

00:10:00.404 --> 00:10:01.644
Then I implore Your Eminence

00:10:02.083 --> 00:10:03.723
to shed outdated beliefs swiftly

00:10:04.164 --> 00:10:04.884
and reconsider

00:10:04.884 --> 00:10:06.364
your current standing.

00:10:07.004 --> 00:10:08.203
Behind you now

00:10:08.644 --> 00:10:09.803
stand countless clan members.

00:10:10.244 --> 00:10:11.803
I don't need your elaboration.

00:10:11.923 --> 00:10:13.484
I'm fully aware.

00:10:13.764 --> 00:10:14.683
For now,

00:10:14.803 --> 00:10:15.884
take those two at the door

00:10:15.884 --> 00:10:16.884
away from me.

00:10:18.563 --> 00:10:19.443
They were assigned

00:10:19.803 --> 00:10:21.563
to take care of you

00:10:21.603 --> 00:10:22.923
and help you adjust.

00:10:23.404 --> 00:10:25.284
When acclimated,

00:10:25.524 --> 00:10:26.524
you may replace them

00:10:27.124 --> 00:10:28.044
as you wish.

00:10:45.644 --> 00:10:46.484
Do you believe

00:10:46.644 --> 00:10:48.164
Kong Hou is truly as portrayed?

00:10:56.723 --> 00:10:58.164
Whether she is or not,

00:10:59.923 --> 00:11:01.484
as a demon cultivator myself,

00:11:01.923 --> 00:11:03.083
I understand well

00:11:03.443 --> 00:11:04.683
the pain of lowly origins

00:11:05.124 --> 00:11:06.124
scorned and reviled

00:11:06.124 --> 00:11:07.484
by others.

00:11:08.083 --> 00:11:09.124
Now, Young Master

00:11:09.404 --> 00:11:10.404
is gravely injured.

00:11:11.723 --> 00:11:12.284
Well...

00:11:12.284 --> 00:11:14.124
Quit feeling sorry for yourself.

00:11:14.644 --> 00:11:15.244
If you think

00:11:15.244 --> 00:11:16.323
the world scorns you, fight

00:11:16.323 --> 00:11:17.244
to prove them wrong.

00:11:17.683 --> 00:11:18.764
If the path is rocky,

00:11:18.764 --> 00:11:19.963
trample it beneath your feet.

00:11:20.803 --> 00:11:22.083
You once asked me

00:11:22.083 --> 00:11:22.963
if helping Kong Hou

00:11:22.963 --> 00:11:23.764
was a mistake.

00:11:23.764 --> 00:11:25.044
Now, I answer you clearly.

00:11:25.244 --> 00:11:26.443
We did no wrong.

00:11:27.004 --> 00:11:28.404
Were it another cast aside,

00:11:28.404 --> 00:11:29.683
not Kong Hou,

00:11:29.683 --> 00:11:30.764
I'd act the same.

00:11:30.764 --> 00:11:31.603
I'd help them

00:11:31.603 --> 00:11:33.323
because it's right.

00:11:33.683 --> 00:11:34.203
Well...

00:11:35.884 --> 00:11:37.723
Both Master Zhong Xi and Kong Hou

00:11:37.723 --> 00:11:38.404
need you.

00:11:38.803 --> 00:11:39.244
Come on.

00:11:40.323 --> 00:11:41.244
Stop being sentimental.

00:11:45.083 --> 00:11:45.683
Wait.

00:11:47.484 --> 00:11:48.323
Hey,

00:11:49.203 --> 00:11:51.563
I'm not sentimental.

00:11:53.083 --> 00:11:54.963
What makes you think so?

00:11:56.284 --> 00:11:56.803
Ling Bo.

00:11:58.484 --> 00:11:59.164
You're back.

00:12:00.443 --> 00:12:02.603
Do you need something?

00:12:02.843 --> 00:12:05.443
It's nothing urgent.

00:12:07.524 --> 00:12:09.124
Then why come?

00:12:09.803 --> 00:12:12.203
I just want to see you.

00:12:14.644 --> 00:12:15.923
If you're free,

00:12:16.164 --> 00:12:17.843
visit your Master instead.

00:12:18.563 --> 00:12:19.203
Master?

00:12:19.683 --> 00:12:20.923
I met him this morning.

00:12:21.323 --> 00:12:22.484
The leader and Master Song He

00:12:22.484 --> 00:12:23.723
regulated his energy already.

00:12:23.764 --> 00:12:24.764
He'll recover fully.

00:12:25.764 --> 00:12:26.484
Good.

00:12:28.124 --> 00:12:29.244
Anything else?

00:12:29.603 --> 00:12:31.364
It's getting late.

00:12:31.524 --> 00:12:33.083
You should go back and rest.

00:12:36.124 --> 00:12:36.843
Ling Bo.

00:12:39.843 --> 00:12:40.884
I'm ashamed.

00:12:41.364 --> 00:12:42.203
All these years,

00:12:43.284 --> 00:12:44.603
we've drifted apart.

00:12:45.963 --> 00:12:46.563
Ah, I heard

00:12:46.884 --> 00:12:47.884
your master's health

00:12:48.083 --> 00:12:50.323
has improved greatly.

00:12:52.164 --> 00:12:55.044
Indeed. When I last wrote to you...

00:13:01.884 --> 00:13:03.563
Anyway, back then,

00:13:03.683 --> 00:13:04.723
my master's condition

00:13:04.723 --> 00:13:05.884
was truly dire.

00:13:06.563 --> 00:13:08.164
But years of recuperation

00:13:08.323 --> 00:13:09.484
have restored her fully.

00:13:09.764 --> 00:13:11.203
I'm glad to hear that.

00:13:12.244 --> 00:13:13.443
I shall

00:13:13.563 --> 00:13:14.764
visit her

00:13:14.764 --> 00:13:15.963
another day.

00:13:26.723 --> 00:13:27.364
Well?

00:13:27.563 --> 00:13:29.244
Master Zhong Xi is still sleeping?

00:13:36.124 --> 00:13:37.723
The ground's dirty. Mind your dress.

00:13:37.963 --> 00:13:39.443
You're sitting here too.

00:13:44.484 --> 00:13:45.284
You seem

00:13:45.963 --> 00:13:47.364
different somehow.

00:13:48.203 --> 00:13:49.803
Let's cut to the chase.

00:13:51.244 --> 00:13:52.364
What brings you here?

00:13:54.884 --> 00:13:57.484
Though it's not a good time,

00:13:57.484 --> 00:13:59.244
the situation is urgent.

00:13:59.323 --> 00:14:00.284
I truly can't think of

00:14:00.284 --> 00:14:01.284
any other solution.

00:14:02.364 --> 00:14:03.603
What do you want to say?

00:14:03.644 --> 00:14:04.723
Why are you hesitating?

00:14:05.644 --> 00:14:08.244
Well...

00:14:08.963 --> 00:14:10.124
Spit it out!

00:14:10.404 --> 00:14:11.083
Just say it!

00:14:11.124 --> 00:14:11.963
Lin Hu,

00:14:12.164 --> 00:14:13.484
could you do me a favor?

00:14:13.764 --> 00:14:14.284
Well,

00:14:17.803 --> 00:14:18.364
a favor?

00:14:19.603 --> 00:14:21.284
You suddenly asking for my help

00:14:21.364 --> 00:14:23.683
gives me an ominous feeling.

00:14:24.524 --> 00:14:26.044
Don't worry.

00:14:28.364 --> 00:14:30.404
Could you stay with me?

00:14:31.083 --> 00:14:31.683
What?

00:14:31.963 --> 00:14:33.083
Can you, Lin Hu?

00:14:33.083 --> 00:14:34.404
Is it possible?

00:14:36.683 --> 00:14:38.404
You...

00:14:39.083 --> 00:14:40.364
You spring this on me.

00:14:40.364 --> 00:14:40.884
I...

00:14:40.884 --> 00:14:43.083
I need a moment to process.

00:14:43.124 --> 00:14:43.683
Well...

00:14:43.803 --> 00:14:45.404
You're misunderstanding this completely!

00:14:45.524 --> 00:14:46.884
Not literally being together,

00:14:46.884 --> 00:14:48.803
just pretending!

00:14:49.404 --> 00:14:50.364
We pretend to be?

00:14:51.323 --> 00:14:54.004
Pretending to be with you?

00:14:54.404 --> 00:14:55.323
What do you mean?

00:14:55.524 --> 00:14:57.524
It's all because of Xiao Dong!

00:14:57.524 --> 00:14:58.843
He's a fool.

00:14:58.923 --> 00:15:01.004
He told my master

00:15:01.083 --> 00:15:02.603
that he wanted to marry me.

00:15:02.603 --> 00:15:03.323
What?

00:15:03.524 --> 00:15:05.603
He actually did that?

00:15:06.203 --> 00:15:09.203
Did your master agree?

00:15:10.524 --> 00:15:11.843
Of course not!

00:15:13.203 --> 00:15:14.404
Well, that's good.

00:15:14.603 --> 00:15:15.524
But Xiao Dong

00:15:15.524 --> 00:15:16.764
is as stubborn as a mule.

00:15:17.124 --> 00:15:18.884
No reasoning gets through to him.

00:15:18.884 --> 00:15:20.484
He insists on marrying me.

00:15:21.083 --> 00:15:22.404
I gave him the cold shoulder,

00:15:22.404 --> 00:15:23.443
but it didn't work.

00:15:24.004 --> 00:15:25.044
What a headache!

00:15:25.723 --> 00:15:27.603
That's why I came to you.

00:15:28.683 --> 00:15:29.923
So,

00:15:30.524 --> 00:15:31.723
you want

00:15:31.963 --> 00:15:33.723
to pretend to be with me

00:15:33.764 --> 00:15:34.764
to trick Xiao Dong?

00:15:36.524 --> 00:15:37.563
No, no way!

00:15:37.644 --> 00:15:39.364
This isn't acceptable!

00:15:40.244 --> 00:15:41.004
Fine.

00:15:41.764 --> 00:15:42.603
If you truly

00:15:42.603 --> 00:15:43.723
feel uncomfortable about it,

00:15:44.083 --> 00:15:45.843
I'll handle it myself.

00:15:46.004 --> 00:15:47.603
It's not like that.

00:15:47.723 --> 00:15:48.284
Ling Bo,

00:15:48.963 --> 00:15:51.284
I didn't mean that.

00:15:52.004 --> 00:15:53.443
Ling Bo, listen...

00:15:54.603 --> 00:15:55.764
Ling Bo, I...

00:16:33.843 --> 00:16:34.404
Kong Hou.

00:16:38.884 --> 00:16:39.552
Your Eminence.

00:16:40.364 --> 00:16:41.164
What

00:16:41.164 --> 00:16:42.004
brings you here?

00:16:42.644 --> 00:16:43.764
As your leader,

00:16:43.963 --> 00:16:45.723
I own the entire place.

00:16:46.603 --> 00:16:47.923
I can go anywhere I want.

00:16:49.044 --> 00:16:50.124
You're right.

00:16:50.603 --> 00:16:52.683
But I was cultivating myself earlier.

00:16:53.004 --> 00:16:54.404
If I hadn't noticed you,

00:16:54.563 --> 00:16:55.764
I fear I would have hurt you.

00:16:56.083 --> 00:16:57.203
What's there to fear?

00:16:57.923 --> 00:17:00.164
When my dark energy went berserk before,

00:17:00.164 --> 00:17:04.123
did I not harm others then?

00:17:05.684 --> 00:17:08.244
You came to see me

00:17:08.764 --> 00:17:09.724
because your dark energy

00:17:09.924 --> 00:17:11.244
is almost out of control

00:17:11.403 --> 00:17:12.323
and has intensified.

00:17:12.643 --> 00:17:14.204
You need more spiritual energy, right?

00:17:14.764 --> 00:17:16.204
You promised earlier

00:17:16.764 --> 00:17:18.163
that if I returned with you,

00:17:18.323 --> 00:17:19.204
you'd teach me

00:17:19.204 --> 00:17:20.643
how to control the dark energy.

00:17:21.083 --> 00:17:22.004
But now,

00:17:22.004 --> 00:17:23.563
after all this time,

00:17:23.724 --> 00:17:24.924
you still haven't

00:17:24.924 --> 00:17:25.964
taught me how.

00:17:27.083 --> 00:17:28.284
Why would I deceive you?

00:17:30.323 --> 00:17:31.363
Bring them in.

00:17:32.764 --> 00:17:33.244
Move.

00:17:36.524 --> 00:17:37.123
Kneel.

00:17:38.803 --> 00:17:39.883
What are you doing?

00:17:40.123 --> 00:17:41.403
I'll show you now

00:17:42.083 --> 00:17:43.643
how to control the dark energy.

00:17:55.323 --> 00:17:56.563
I need you to tell me

00:17:56.603 --> 00:17:57.964
how to control the dark energy,

00:17:58.284 --> 00:17:59.244
not to have you

00:17:59.244 --> 00:18:00.363
cruelly harm others.

00:18:00.724 --> 00:18:01.924
After the seal was broken.

00:18:02.123 --> 00:18:03.724
You regained your true nature.

00:18:04.284 --> 00:18:05.964
The techniques we practice are unique.

00:18:06.323 --> 00:18:07.083
Therefore,

00:18:07.803 --> 00:18:09.284
they demand certain sacrifices.

00:18:09.444 --> 00:18:09.964
Well,

00:18:10.363 --> 00:18:12.244
this is how to control dark energy.

00:18:23.764 --> 00:18:24.444
Your Eminence.

00:18:25.403 --> 00:18:26.123
These two

00:18:26.724 --> 00:18:28.524
were carefully chosen for you.

00:18:28.724 --> 00:18:30.004
Their spiritual energy is huge.

00:18:30.484 --> 00:18:31.244
Release them.

00:18:33.524 --> 00:18:34.204
Your Eminence.

00:18:34.724 --> 00:18:36.204
Are you pitying them now?

00:18:36.403 --> 00:18:38.044
Release them immediately!

00:18:45.204 --> 00:18:47.764
You're despicable!

00:18:50.123 --> 00:18:51.323
For our kind,

00:18:52.204 --> 00:18:53.004
compassion

00:18:53.163 --> 00:18:54.883
is the most dangerous weakness.

00:18:55.083 --> 00:18:56.684
It will destroy you.

00:18:56.883 --> 00:18:58.163
But don't worry.

00:18:58.563 --> 00:19:00.004
You're young and innocent.

00:19:00.403 --> 00:19:02.883
Time will teach you.

00:19:03.083 --> 00:19:04.284
This world

00:19:04.684 --> 00:19:05.724
is cruel.

00:19:06.284 --> 00:19:09.004
Only the strong devour the weak.

00:19:09.803 --> 00:19:12.083
I'd rather never understand

00:19:12.724 --> 00:19:14.403
your twisted principles.

00:19:14.444 --> 00:19:15.603
I know you don't understand.

00:19:17.044 --> 00:19:18.284
But do you know

00:19:18.803 --> 00:19:20.044
what our people

00:19:20.044 --> 00:19:21.163
have been suffering?

00:19:21.524 --> 00:19:22.883
Failing to control dark energy.

00:19:23.163 --> 00:19:24.403
Living like monsters!

00:19:24.883 --> 00:19:25.563
All of this

00:19:26.163 --> 00:19:27.323
was caused

00:19:27.323 --> 00:19:28.724
by those hypocrites.

00:19:29.444 --> 00:19:30.964
We take cultivators' spiritual energy

00:19:31.524 --> 00:19:32.924
to retaliate.

00:19:33.724 --> 00:19:35.163
What are you implying?

00:19:36.123 --> 00:19:37.123
You mean

00:19:37.323 --> 00:19:38.524
they're to blame?

00:19:39.004 --> 00:19:40.403
Speak plainly!

00:19:40.563 --> 00:19:41.444
Now

00:19:42.004 --> 00:19:42.924
is not the time

00:19:42.924 --> 00:19:43.883
to tell you everything.

00:19:44.284 --> 00:19:44.964
One day,

00:19:45.803 --> 00:19:47.163
you'll understand everything.

00:19:49.764 --> 00:19:50.883
For now,

00:19:51.524 --> 00:19:53.244
please absorb spiritual energy.

00:19:56.524 --> 00:19:57.563
I'll never

00:19:58.524 --> 00:20:00.204
follow your ways.

00:20:00.484 --> 00:20:01.044
Fine.

00:20:02.484 --> 00:20:03.524
Since that's your choice,

00:20:04.524 --> 00:20:05.524
these cultivators

00:20:05.524 --> 00:20:06.484
are useless.

00:20:06.764 --> 00:20:08.764
Just kill them.

00:20:08.883 --> 00:20:09.524
Don't you dare!

00:20:10.764 --> 00:20:11.764
I am

00:20:11.924 --> 00:20:13.083
your leader.

00:20:13.684 --> 00:20:14.643
You shall

00:20:14.643 --> 00:20:16.563
follow my rules.

00:20:17.163 --> 00:20:18.204
Or else,

00:20:18.563 --> 00:20:19.563
I won't stay

00:20:19.764 --> 00:20:21.044
anymore.

00:20:30.123 --> 00:20:30.724
Your Eminence.

00:20:31.563 --> 00:20:32.843
I overstepped earlier.

00:20:34.724 --> 00:20:35.764
If you refuse

00:20:35.843 --> 00:20:37.083
to absorb spiritual energy,

00:20:37.764 --> 00:20:38.964
you will have to

00:20:39.643 --> 00:20:41.163
endure the pain.

00:20:58.244 --> 00:20:59.563
Young Master is not awake yet.

00:21:00.123 --> 00:21:01.484
Yet trouble arises again.

00:21:03.563 --> 00:21:05.163
Why must Xiao Dong

00:21:05.163 --> 00:21:06.603
fancy Ling Bo?

00:21:06.924 --> 00:21:08.484
He even sought her master's approval.

00:21:08.643 --> 00:21:09.083
Well,

00:21:09.924 --> 00:21:10.684
what if

00:21:11.004 --> 00:21:12.484
her master allows him

00:21:12.484 --> 00:21:13.524
to marry Ling Bo?

00:21:16.044 --> 00:21:17.284
What should I do?

00:21:17.284 --> 00:21:17.724
Well...

00:21:20.363 --> 00:21:21.484
Is Master Zhong Xi awake?

00:21:23.883 --> 00:21:25.123
Why are you at my door?

00:21:25.244 --> 00:21:27.843
I-I was passing by for medicine.

00:21:28.244 --> 00:21:29.444
Passing by?

00:21:30.444 --> 00:21:31.392
Where's the medicine?

00:21:31.724 --> 00:21:33.403
Tell me the truth!

00:21:34.244 --> 00:21:34.964
Well,

00:21:35.004 --> 00:21:37.004
you wanted my help, right?

00:21:37.563 --> 00:21:38.964
You declined earlier.

00:21:39.563 --> 00:21:41.044
I've changed my mind.

00:21:41.244 --> 00:21:43.603
Let me talk to Xiao Dong.

00:21:43.643 --> 00:21:45.123
Truly? You'll help?

00:21:45.244 --> 00:21:45.843
Sure. I can't

00:21:45.964 --> 00:21:46.964
watch you stay

00:21:46.964 --> 00:21:48.123
with Xiao Dong.

00:21:51.204 --> 00:21:51.843
Come on.

00:21:52.083 --> 00:21:52.964
Why the silence?

00:21:53.163 --> 00:21:54.444
Will you marry him?

00:21:54.643 --> 00:21:55.803
What are you talking about?

00:21:55.803 --> 00:21:57.163
You know it.

00:21:57.204 --> 00:21:58.244
Have you thought of that?

00:21:58.244 --> 00:21:59.004
What thoughts?

00:21:59.004 --> 00:22:00.444
Of marrying him.

00:22:01.163 --> 00:22:02.044
I've heard of it.

00:22:02.083 --> 00:22:02.843
You two were...

00:22:02.843 --> 00:22:03.563
That's not true.

00:22:06.403 --> 00:22:07.004
Really?

00:22:07.296 --> 00:22:09.044
If there is something
between him and me,

00:22:09.044 --> 00:22:09.924
why would I need you?

00:22:12.444 --> 00:22:13.643
I'm glad that it's true.

00:22:28.004 --> 00:22:28.724
The two of you...

00:22:31.083 --> 00:22:31.684
What is this?

00:22:33.444 --> 00:22:35.044
Xiao Dong, listen,

00:22:35.083 --> 00:22:36.244
given the current situation,

00:22:36.244 --> 00:22:37.323
it's difficult to explain.

00:22:37.724 --> 00:22:38.724
Actually, Ling Bo and I

00:22:38.724 --> 00:22:39.724
are already

00:22:39.964 --> 00:22:41.163
in love.

00:22:42.163 --> 00:22:44.323
With so much happening lately,

00:22:44.363 --> 00:22:46.083
we feared
announcing it would be improper.

00:22:46.204 --> 00:22:48.044
So, we never make it public.

00:22:49.323 --> 00:22:49.803
Exactly.

00:22:50.204 --> 00:22:51.444
But we realize

00:22:51.603 --> 00:22:52.563
if we don't,

00:22:52.563 --> 00:22:53.603
you'll misunderstand.

00:22:53.643 --> 00:22:55.444
So today, we must make it clear.

00:22:55.843 --> 00:22:57.204
Ling Bo and I

00:22:57.403 --> 00:22:58.244
are already together.

00:22:58.684 --> 00:23:00.044
I am the one Ling Bo loves.

00:23:00.323 --> 00:23:01.964
And she is my beloved.

00:23:02.403 --> 00:23:03.563
We love each other.

00:23:05.484 --> 00:23:06.363
Why are you laughing?

00:23:06.924 --> 00:23:09.204
You think I'm lying to you?

00:23:10.964 --> 00:23:11.883
Do you think

00:23:11.964 --> 00:23:12.883
that if you and Lin Hu

00:23:12.883 --> 00:23:13.883
pretend to be together,

00:23:13.883 --> 00:23:14.964
it will make me give up?

00:23:15.603 --> 00:23:17.123
You can't deceive me, Ling Bo.

00:23:17.803 --> 00:23:18.643
Nor can you

00:23:18.643 --> 00:23:19.524
alter my resolution.

00:23:21.323 --> 00:23:22.524
You and Lin Hu

00:23:23.363 --> 00:23:24.244
aren't together.

00:23:24.484 --> 00:23:25.803
Who says we're not?

00:23:25.803 --> 00:23:27.403
Who says we're not?

00:23:29.484 --> 00:23:30.323
If you're with him,

00:23:30.323 --> 00:23:31.363
what do you see in him?

00:23:32.244 --> 00:23:33.843
Lin Hu is a demon cultivator.

00:23:34.924 --> 00:23:35.643
Pardon?

00:23:35.764 --> 00:23:36.244
Oh,

00:23:36.284 --> 00:23:37.484
I don't mean to disparage you.

00:23:38.363 --> 00:23:39.083
But even if

00:23:39.363 --> 00:23:40.563
I don't mind,

00:23:40.883 --> 00:23:43.004
your Master would never
allow you two to be together.

00:23:43.323 --> 00:23:44.603
Lin Hu is a demon cultivator,

00:23:44.684 --> 00:23:45.803
but he is righteous.

00:23:46.444 --> 00:23:47.684
His methods seem unorthodox,

00:23:47.964 --> 00:23:49.843
yet he holds firm principles.

00:23:50.163 --> 00:23:50.843
He's loyal,

00:23:51.363 --> 00:23:53.004
willing to follow Master Zhong Xi.

00:23:53.323 --> 00:23:53.843
Whatever

00:23:53.843 --> 00:23:55.204
the difficulties,

00:23:55.284 --> 00:23:56.363
he never betrays Zhong Xi.

00:23:56.883 --> 00:23:57.603
He's kindhearted,

00:23:58.044 --> 00:23:59.403
ensuring no one near him

00:23:59.603 --> 00:24:01.123
comes to harm.

00:24:01.524 --> 00:24:02.484
Most importantly,

00:24:03.163 --> 00:24:04.044
he's responsible.

00:24:04.524 --> 00:24:05.444
In the secret realm,

00:24:05.764 --> 00:24:07.563
when I lost control,
he severed his own tail

00:24:07.563 --> 00:24:08.603
to save my life

00:24:09.643 --> 00:24:10.764
instead of

00:24:10.764 --> 00:24:12.163
abandoning me.

00:24:14.403 --> 00:24:14.883
You...

00:24:15.363 --> 00:24:15.883
Don't cut in.

00:24:17.484 --> 00:24:18.123
She's not done.

00:24:18.123 --> 00:24:19.323
I haven't finished yet.

00:24:19.524 --> 00:24:20.403
She hasn't finished.

00:24:22.643 --> 00:24:23.724
Though

00:24:23.764 --> 00:24:25.123
you often tease me

00:24:25.484 --> 00:24:26.724
and contradict me,

00:24:26.964 --> 00:24:27.684
I still

00:24:28.363 --> 00:24:30.004
don't dislike you for it.

00:24:30.524 --> 00:24:31.524
In fact,

00:24:31.764 --> 00:24:33.403
I enjoy being

00:24:33.403 --> 00:24:34.284
with you.

00:24:34.403 --> 00:24:35.163
So do I.

00:24:39.204 --> 00:24:39.724
It seems

00:24:41.524 --> 00:24:44.004
you genuinely like him.

00:24:44.964 --> 00:24:46.004
So, Xiao Dong,

00:24:46.284 --> 00:24:47.843
Ling Bo and I

00:24:48.004 --> 00:24:49.044
are already together.

00:24:49.204 --> 00:24:51.603
And I'll be with her

00:24:51.843 --> 00:24:52.924
forever and always.

00:24:59.403 --> 00:25:00.204
I understand now.

00:25:01.363 --> 00:25:03.044
- He understood.
- He understood.

00:25:03.044 --> 00:25:04.204
He understood.

00:25:04.803 --> 00:25:05.444
However,

00:25:07.044 --> 00:25:09.004
I'll prove that I love her
more than you do.

00:25:09.004 --> 00:25:09.924
And I'm more deserving

00:25:09.924 --> 00:25:10.803
to be with her.

00:25:11.163 --> 00:25:12.444
- Are you kidding?
- Save your words.

00:25:13.444 --> 00:25:14.123
I'll make you

00:25:14.123 --> 00:25:14.924
feel my love.

00:25:15.204 --> 00:25:16.524
I'll make you change your mind.

00:25:17.603 --> 00:25:18.083
Xiao Dong.

00:25:18.204 --> 00:25:19.284
- Actually...
- Stop it.

00:25:21.643 --> 00:25:22.643
I'm taking the disciples

00:25:22.684 --> 00:25:23.323
for training.

00:25:23.684 --> 00:25:25.724
We'll talk later.

00:25:25.843 --> 00:25:26.803
Are you serious?

00:25:28.724 --> 00:25:29.843
I warned you before.

00:25:29.843 --> 00:25:30.883
What do we do now?

00:25:31.123 --> 00:25:32.204
What do you mean?

00:25:32.284 --> 00:25:34.563
Then I must prove that I love you

00:25:34.563 --> 00:25:35.643
more than he does.

00:25:35.643 --> 00:25:36.403
Alright.

00:25:38.004 --> 00:25:38.643
Your hand?

00:25:39.684 --> 00:25:40.603
S-Sorry.

00:25:41.563 --> 00:25:43.163
Thanks, anyway.

00:25:43.403 --> 00:25:45.204
Don't mention it.
I was just playing along.

00:25:46.004 --> 00:25:47.444
But I have a question.

00:25:47.643 --> 00:25:50.244
Are you serious

00:25:50.244 --> 00:25:52.004
about what you said before?

00:25:52.643 --> 00:25:54.643
Obviously, I just tried

00:25:55.924 --> 00:25:57.764
to convince him.

00:26:00.924 --> 00:26:02.044
You take it seriously?

00:26:02.123 --> 00:26:03.684
O-Of course not.

00:26:03.684 --> 00:26:05.083
Why would I ever believe that?

00:26:05.083 --> 00:26:06.843
I'm not a conceited man.

00:26:08.083 --> 00:26:09.123
Don't take it seriously.

00:26:10.244 --> 00:26:12.843
But actually, I...

00:26:12.843 --> 00:26:13.363
Lin Hu!

00:26:13.843 --> 00:26:14.643
Zhong Xi is awake!

00:26:14.803 --> 00:26:15.563
He has woken?

00:26:15.563 --> 00:26:16.883
I'll take my leave.

00:26:16.964 --> 00:26:18.044
Come on.

00:26:25.924 --> 00:26:26.484
Young Master.

00:26:27.843 --> 00:26:28.803
Where are you going?

00:26:28.964 --> 00:26:29.843
To find Kong Hou.

00:26:30.563 --> 00:26:31.724
You've barely recovered.

00:26:31.724 --> 00:26:33.403
We don't know
Kong Hou's current situation.

00:26:33.403 --> 00:26:34.163
If you act rashly

00:26:34.163 --> 00:26:35.363
and encounter danger again,

00:26:35.524 --> 00:26:36.964
the leader will kill me.

00:26:37.044 --> 00:26:38.883
No worries. I'm fine now.

00:26:38.964 --> 00:26:40.083
Young Master!

00:26:42.403 --> 00:26:42.964
Master.

00:26:44.563 --> 00:26:45.484
What are you doing?

00:26:46.004 --> 00:26:47.004
To find Kong Hou.

00:26:47.444 --> 00:26:48.284
Absurd!

00:26:48.764 --> 00:26:51.044
Lin Hu! Confine him!

00:26:53.643 --> 00:26:54.284
Master.

00:26:56.363 --> 00:26:57.764
Kong Hou is innocent.

00:26:58.403 --> 00:26:59.484
She can't

00:26:59.484 --> 00:27:00.524
choose her origins,

00:27:01.244 --> 00:27:02.883
but she's done nothing wrong.

00:27:03.484 --> 00:27:05.204
Besides, she's my wife.

00:27:05.883 --> 00:27:06.964
I must bring her back.

00:27:07.204 --> 00:27:07.964
Zhong Xi.

00:27:08.643 --> 00:27:11.123
Regardless of her innocence,

00:27:11.363 --> 00:27:12.363
if you persist now,

00:27:12.363 --> 00:27:13.724
you'll make

00:27:13.964 --> 00:27:14.764
both yourself

00:27:14.764 --> 00:27:15.643
and Liuguang Sect

00:27:15.643 --> 00:27:17.044
targets of public outrage.

00:27:17.684 --> 00:27:18.403
By then,

00:27:18.883 --> 00:27:19.724
do you think

00:27:20.004 --> 00:27:21.484
you'll get any chance

00:27:21.724 --> 00:27:23.083
to explain yourself to her?

00:27:23.484 --> 00:27:25.363
Even if you retrieve her,

00:27:25.444 --> 00:27:27.403
without a proper plan,

00:27:27.403 --> 00:27:28.724
she'll just end up

00:27:28.724 --> 00:27:30.403
constantly hiding again.

00:27:31.643 --> 00:27:32.524
Is that what

00:27:32.883 --> 00:27:34.444
you want for her?

00:27:37.083 --> 00:27:38.204
I understand,

00:27:40.563 --> 00:27:41.883
but whenever I think

00:27:42.524 --> 00:27:44.204
she is now trapped by Jiusu,

00:27:45.163 --> 00:27:46.603
enduring something,

00:27:47.403 --> 00:27:48.684
possibly in danger,

00:27:50.004 --> 00:27:51.764
I can't restrain myself.

00:28:03.163 --> 00:28:04.123
I have failed you.

00:28:06.004 --> 00:28:07.363
I beg your permission.

00:28:27.964 --> 00:28:28.444
Hurry!

00:28:30.603 --> 00:28:31.163
Kneel!

00:28:31.163 --> 00:28:32.083
Your Eminence.

00:28:34.883 --> 00:28:36.163
What's the meaning of this?

00:28:36.764 --> 00:28:37.524
Your Eminence.

00:28:37.524 --> 00:28:39.284
Lord Jiusu sent two cultivators

00:28:39.363 --> 00:28:40.163
for you.

00:28:40.484 --> 00:28:41.184
Take them away.

00:28:41.724 --> 00:28:42.444
I've said before.

00:28:42.643 --> 00:28:44.603
I don't need others' spiritual energy.

00:28:44.764 --> 00:28:45.563
Why must you

00:28:45.563 --> 00:28:46.484
harm yourself?

00:28:46.803 --> 00:28:47.843
One or two cultivators

00:28:48.083 --> 00:28:49.603
could alleviate your suffering.

00:28:50.083 --> 00:28:51.204
Forcibly suppressing it

00:28:51.363 --> 00:28:52.163
is futile.

00:28:52.684 --> 00:28:53.323
Get away.

00:28:53.803 --> 00:28:55.044
One more word,

00:28:55.563 --> 00:28:56.684
and I'll kill you.

00:28:56.964 --> 00:28:57.724
Forgive me.

00:28:57.924 --> 00:28:58.764
I'll take my leave.

00:28:59.603 --> 00:29:01.244
If you change your mind,

00:29:01.524 --> 00:29:02.764
summon me at any time.

00:29:03.555 --> 00:29:04.119
Get lost!

00:29:19.843 --> 00:29:22.244
Why are you hunting these cultivators?

00:29:22.764 --> 00:29:24.123
By order of Master Wu Bei,

00:29:24.363 --> 00:29:26.004
we gather cultivators for our new leader

00:29:26.163 --> 00:29:27.163
to gain their energy.

00:29:27.603 --> 00:29:30.004
Who is the new leader?

00:29:30.244 --> 00:29:31.044
Lowly ones like us

00:29:31.044 --> 00:29:32.004
never see the Sovereign.

00:29:32.964 --> 00:29:34.964
We only heard she's a female cultivator.

00:29:36.244 --> 00:29:37.163
Kong Hou?

00:29:38.403 --> 00:29:39.123
Impossible.

00:29:39.883 --> 00:29:40.563
Sir,

00:29:40.803 --> 00:29:42.363
don't believe these dark cultivators.

00:29:42.724 --> 00:29:43.484
If you spare them,

00:29:43.484 --> 00:29:44.524
they will kill again.

00:29:45.083 --> 00:29:46.323
You're injured.

00:29:46.643 --> 00:29:47.843
Return to your sect.

00:29:48.363 --> 00:29:49.883
I'll deal with these dark cultivators.

00:29:50.603 --> 00:29:51.843
Thank you.

00:29:56.563 --> 00:29:57.403
You...

00:29:58.323 --> 00:29:58.764
Leave.

00:29:59.484 --> 00:30:00.044
Go!

00:30:03.563 --> 00:30:04.484
I hear

00:30:05.123 --> 00:30:06.684
you've proposed to Lady Ling Bo.

00:30:06.684 --> 00:30:07.724
Is this true?

00:30:10.044 --> 00:30:10.843
You knew already?

00:30:11.083 --> 00:30:13.163
Did you think you could hide it from me?

00:30:14.284 --> 00:30:15.004
Answer me.

00:30:15.403 --> 00:30:16.843
Do you genuinely

00:30:16.883 --> 00:30:18.524
like Lady Ling Bo?

00:30:18.924 --> 00:30:21.123
Well, I do.

00:30:21.764 --> 00:30:24.603
I know your nature better than anyone.

00:30:25.163 --> 00:30:26.044
Or perhaps

00:30:26.444 --> 00:30:28.363
you like her for her status?

00:30:29.083 --> 00:30:30.684
Since I taught you,

00:30:31.204 --> 00:30:32.964
you've focused solely on cultivation.

00:30:33.764 --> 00:30:35.083
We both know

00:30:35.724 --> 00:30:38.563
Zhong Xi is top one

00:30:39.284 --> 00:30:40.724
in Liuguang Sect,

00:30:40.724 --> 00:30:41.603
even in Lingyou Realm.

00:30:42.004 --> 00:30:42.643
However,

00:30:43.123 --> 00:30:45.603
you want

00:30:45.964 --> 00:30:47.764
to stand out

00:30:48.123 --> 00:30:49.603
more than anyone.

00:30:49.603 --> 00:30:50.123
Master.

00:30:51.323 --> 00:30:52.083
Are you saying

00:30:52.524 --> 00:30:53.684
I'm trying to stand out

00:30:54.403 --> 00:30:55.563
by courting Lady Ling Bo?

00:30:56.684 --> 00:30:57.964
Even if that's true, what does

00:30:58.204 --> 00:30:59.603
that have to do with her status?

00:31:00.643 --> 00:31:02.603
Ling Bo is the daughter
of Zhaohan Sect's leader.

00:31:02.603 --> 00:31:04.004
You think I don't know?

00:31:05.444 --> 00:31:06.163
Years ago,

00:31:07.244 --> 00:31:09.083
when you befriended her,

00:31:09.643 --> 00:31:11.123
did you

00:31:12.163 --> 00:31:13.284
calculate her potential

00:31:13.284 --> 00:31:15.363
to become Zhaohan Sect's next leader?

00:31:17.803 --> 00:31:19.004
I always believed

00:31:19.004 --> 00:31:20.803
you were a clever man.

00:31:21.883 --> 00:31:24.484
But cleverness often
becomes its own trap.

00:31:24.724 --> 00:31:25.684
I'm telling you,

00:31:26.363 --> 00:31:27.323
in matters of the heart,

00:31:27.363 --> 00:31:29.403
opportunism spells doom.

00:31:29.403 --> 00:31:30.484
I'm not an opportunist.

00:31:30.563 --> 00:31:31.323
Aren't you?

00:31:31.643 --> 00:31:32.484
Then why now

00:31:33.363 --> 00:31:34.403
do you persistently

00:31:34.403 --> 00:31:35.684
court her favor?

00:31:37.524 --> 00:31:39.244
The Zhaohan Sect leader's health
improves.

00:31:40.363 --> 00:31:41.004
After all,

00:31:41.004 --> 00:31:42.044
Ling Bo is her daughter.

00:31:42.563 --> 00:31:43.444
You...

00:31:45.083 --> 00:31:46.643
At least, you're honest.

00:31:46.643 --> 00:31:47.724
Master Song He,

00:31:56.123 --> 00:31:57.764
may I speak with him privately?

00:32:00.764 --> 00:32:01.643
Master...

00:32:05.004 --> 00:32:07.363
You heard everything?

00:32:07.724 --> 00:32:09.563
So if I hadn't learned this,

00:32:10.363 --> 00:32:11.724
you'd still pursue me

00:32:11.843 --> 00:32:12.764
for my status?

00:32:14.204 --> 00:32:15.643
I-I'm sorry.

00:32:17.363 --> 00:32:18.603
Had you not been exposed,

00:32:19.123 --> 00:32:19.803
would you

00:32:19.803 --> 00:32:20.724
apologize to me?

00:32:25.403 --> 00:32:26.244
What's done is done.

00:32:28.204 --> 00:32:29.444
I've nothing more to say.

00:32:29.803 --> 00:32:30.764
I'm terribly sorry.

00:32:31.563 --> 00:32:32.764
I don't need your apologies.

00:32:33.883 --> 00:32:34.964
People aim for higher.

00:32:35.524 --> 00:32:36.764
Striving to stand out

00:32:37.004 --> 00:32:37.764
is reasonable.

00:32:38.724 --> 00:32:39.803
However,

00:32:42.803 --> 00:32:44.444
since childhood, I've feared others

00:32:45.123 --> 00:32:46.603
seeing me as the leader's daughter,

00:32:46.603 --> 00:32:47.924
assuming I abuse my privilege.

00:32:48.284 --> 00:32:49.123
I also feared people

00:32:49.123 --> 00:32:50.284
thinking me incompetent,

00:32:50.724 --> 00:32:51.444
always relying

00:32:51.444 --> 00:32:52.563
on her esteemed status.

00:32:55.163 --> 00:32:56.244
Yet I never imagined

00:32:56.764 --> 00:32:58.004
that in your eyes,

00:32:58.403 --> 00:32:59.204
my identity

00:32:59.484 --> 00:33:00.964
is precisely my worth.

00:33:01.444 --> 00:33:01.924
I...

00:33:03.843 --> 00:33:05.123
All these years of growth,

00:33:05.964 --> 00:33:07.484
I've been striving to prove myself.

00:33:08.004 --> 00:33:08.684
Yet in the end,

00:33:09.284 --> 00:33:10.284
I'm still trapped

00:33:10.284 --> 00:33:12.044
by being the sect leader's daughter.

00:33:12.524 --> 00:33:14.044
Ling Bo, don't say that.

00:33:14.244 --> 00:33:15.004
It's okay.

00:33:15.964 --> 00:33:16.803
Now,

00:33:16.803 --> 00:33:18.163
I have greater priorities.

00:33:18.444 --> 00:33:19.284
From now on,

00:33:19.764 --> 00:33:20.764
don't pester me anymore.

00:33:21.444 --> 00:33:22.204
Between us,

00:33:23.284 --> 00:33:24.004
all is settled.

00:33:24.363 --> 00:33:25.724
Listen to me, Ling Bo!

00:33:26.163 --> 00:33:26.603
Wait.

00:33:31.924 --> 00:33:32.643
Who's there?

00:33:33.204 --> 00:33:33.724
Guys,

00:33:34.044 --> 00:33:35.764
I am Lin Hu from Liuguang Sect.

00:33:38.284 --> 00:33:38.964
Apologies.

00:33:39.323 --> 00:33:40.284
Nice to meet you.

00:33:41.883 --> 00:33:42.924
Might I inquire

00:33:43.204 --> 00:33:45.004
what happened here?

00:33:45.684 --> 00:33:46.843
While returning to our sect,

00:33:46.883 --> 00:33:48.928
dark cultivators ambushed us,
trying to seize us

00:33:49.004 --> 00:33:50.163
to provide spiritual energy

00:33:50.163 --> 00:33:50.964
for their Sovereign.

00:33:51.524 --> 00:33:52.284
A cultivator

00:33:52.284 --> 00:33:52.964
helped us.

00:33:53.083 --> 00:33:53.964
We narrowly survived.

00:33:54.444 --> 00:33:55.083
A cultivator?

00:33:55.524 --> 00:33:57.123
What does he look like?

00:33:57.244 --> 00:33:58.883
His skills are exceptional,

00:33:59.044 --> 00:34:00.083
with high cultivation.

00:34:00.524 --> 00:34:02.144
He might be a Master from a major sect.

00:34:02.484 --> 00:34:03.244
Young Master?

00:34:03.764 --> 00:34:05.123
Do you know his whereabouts?

00:34:25.884 --> 00:34:26.763
Why are you here?

00:34:27.283 --> 00:34:28.044
- Looking for Young Master.
- Looking for Zhong Xi.

00:34:29.763 --> 00:34:30.243
Wait,

00:34:30.444 --> 00:34:31.723
why are you seeking him?

00:34:31.924 --> 00:34:32.804
To find out the truth

00:34:32.804 --> 00:34:33.723
about Kong Hou.

00:34:34.364 --> 00:34:35.243
Come on.

00:34:35.243 --> 00:34:37.444
This area is full of dark cultivators.
It's perilous.

00:34:37.563 --> 00:34:38.404
I'll handle it alone.

00:34:38.444 --> 00:34:39.123
Stay out of this.

00:34:39.324 --> 00:34:40.404
Don't underestimate me.

00:34:40.524 --> 00:34:41.683
Can you handle it alone?

00:34:41.964 --> 00:34:42.364
Look,

00:34:42.364 --> 00:34:43.563
I never underestimated you.

00:34:43.643 --> 00:34:45.004
I'm concerned for your safety!

00:34:45.083 --> 00:34:46.683
Your concern is unnecessary.

00:34:46.804 --> 00:34:47.603
Worry about

00:34:47.603 --> 00:34:48.683
your own safety.

00:34:51.763 --> 00:34:52.444
Regardless,

00:34:52.444 --> 00:34:53.723
you're worried about Zhong Xi,

00:34:54.004 --> 00:34:54.563
while I

00:34:54.563 --> 00:34:55.683
will uncover the truth.

00:34:55.804 --> 00:34:56.723
Let's go together then.

00:34:56.964 --> 00:34:57.563
We can

00:34:57.603 --> 00:34:58.324
work together.

00:34:59.844 --> 00:35:00.884
Fine, whatever.

00:35:17.524 --> 00:35:18.203
Your Eminence.

00:35:19.924 --> 00:35:20.603
Your Eminence.

00:35:21.044 --> 00:35:22.243
Why did you come abruptly?

00:35:22.524 --> 00:35:23.444
What happened?

00:35:23.924 --> 00:35:25.083
An outsider

00:35:25.123 --> 00:35:26.844
insists on meeting Your Eminence.

00:35:27.404 --> 00:35:28.603
Who is it?

00:35:29.364 --> 00:35:30.163
I don't know him.

00:35:30.484 --> 00:35:31.524
He vowed

00:35:31.643 --> 00:35:32.844
not to depart

00:35:33.004 --> 00:35:34.524
without seeing you.

00:35:35.964 --> 00:35:36.683
It's him.

00:35:42.324 --> 00:35:43.283
Master Zhong Xi.

00:35:43.563 --> 00:35:44.524
An unexpected guest.

00:35:45.004 --> 00:35:46.364
What brings you

00:35:46.484 --> 00:35:47.563
here?

00:35:51.364 --> 00:35:52.083
I understand.

00:35:52.563 --> 00:35:53.884
You came for your beloved.

00:35:54.324 --> 00:35:54.884
Is that right?

00:35:55.083 --> 00:35:56.484
Bring Kong Hou here.

00:35:56.683 --> 00:35:57.563
I want to see her.

00:35:57.924 --> 00:35:58.924
Don't worry.

00:35:59.123 --> 00:36:00.083
She's perfectly fine.

00:36:00.324 --> 00:36:02.004
She's my sister.

00:36:02.364 --> 00:36:03.884
How could I ever harm her?

00:36:03.924 --> 00:36:05.683
If I don't get to see her today,

00:36:06.163 --> 00:36:07.563
I will destroy this place!

00:36:07.603 --> 00:36:08.763
Such bold claims.

00:36:09.203 --> 00:36:10.083
Destroy this place?

00:36:10.484 --> 00:36:12.324
With your current condition?

00:36:12.643 --> 00:36:14.004
Aren't you afraid I'll kill you?

00:36:14.163 --> 00:36:16.004
Enough with the chatter.

00:36:16.723 --> 00:36:17.763
Where's Kong Hou?

00:36:18.723 --> 00:36:20.243
Let me remind you of one thing.

00:36:20.723 --> 00:36:22.123
This is my territory.

00:36:22.924 --> 00:36:24.083
Who do you think you are?

00:36:24.404 --> 00:36:25.083
Guards!

00:36:25.123 --> 00:36:25.763
Wait!

00:36:30.283 --> 00:36:31.283
Your Eminence.

00:36:50.603 --> 00:36:51.844
Kong Hou?

00:36:54.924 --> 00:36:56.404
How can you be their Sovereign?

00:36:57.524 --> 00:36:58.283
Yes,

00:36:58.643 --> 00:37:01.203
I am now their Sovereign.

00:37:29.032 --> 00:37:31.599
♪Roaming with the wind♪

00:37:32.044 --> 00:37:34.355
♪Wandering about♪

00:37:34.807 --> 00:37:39.618
♪A final ember of warmth abides♪

00:37:40.752 --> 00:37:42.918
♪Absurd plots unfold♪

00:37:43.394 --> 00:37:45.908
♪Mere spectators♪

00:37:46.172 --> 00:37:50.702
♪Footprints left on shores♪

00:37:52.037 --> 00:37:54.460
♪Fickle kisses burn♪

00:37:54.733 --> 00:37:57.525
♪Withering in an instant♪

00:37:57.640 --> 00:38:02.424
♪Lanterns glow, depicting her grace♪

00:38:03.303 --> 00:38:05.835
♪Like rusted locks♪

00:38:06.203 --> 00:38:08.804
♪Chaining our memories♪

00:38:09.134 --> 00:38:14.096
♪Only scars remain♪

00:38:14.440 --> 00:38:17.108
♪Breaking from worldly desires♪

00:38:17.320 --> 00:38:20.026
♪Dreams shattered, but reality rolls on♪

00:38:20.136 --> 00:38:25.832
♪Letting down my guard,
drowning in the perilous love♪

00:38:25.832 --> 00:38:28.551
♪You stole my heart♪

00:38:28.680 --> 00:38:31.410
♪Vows scatter with the air♪

00:38:31.592 --> 00:38:36.915
♪All the wounds will heal with care♪

00:38:36.915 --> 00:38:40.274
♪Love is mystery♪

00:38:40.617 --> 00:38:43.191
♪So be it♪

00:38:43.304 --> 00:38:46.225
♪She blazes uncontrolled♪

00:38:46.437 --> 00:38:48.718
♪A sickness of the soul♪

00:38:48.718 --> 00:38:51.720
♪Cold nights take their toll♪

00:38:51.880 --> 00:38:54.312
♪So be it♪

00:38:54.562 --> 00:39:00.861
♪All efforts go unrewarded♪

00:39:02.868 --> 00:39:05.512
♪Breaking from worldly desires♪

00:39:06.020 --> 00:39:08.684
♪Dreams shattered, but reality rolls on♪

00:39:08.840 --> 00:39:14.470
♪Letting down my guard,
drowning in the perilous love♪

00:39:14.470 --> 00:39:17.087
♪You stole my heart♪

00:39:17.368 --> 00:39:19.949
♪Vows scatter with the air♪

00:39:20.136 --> 00:39:27.154
♪All the wounds will heal with care♪

00:39:28.936 --> 00:39:31.464
♪So be it♪